{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_14_level_st_14-02","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"st_14-02","title":"自原点中降临","storyCode":"14-13","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_14-02.txt","sourceHash":"dea2e2ae297a7fba009990a2e05eb6946e25662b298808fa4fe51b14ddad7712","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"伦蒂尼姆城内，工人们开始与整合运动合作自救。而“阿喃那”终于完全降临到了碎片大厦的顶端。“生命脊椎”重新起飞，接上了阿米娅等人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这东西是这么用的，对吧？瞄准敌人，然后——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——真该死，太吓人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汤米，不用的时候关上保险，放松点。论危险程度，你平常用的车床也不比这东西安全多少，都是些能让人血肉模糊的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道眼下这个情况，那位白头发的菲林女士到底是从哪里搞来的这些装备......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看这些东西的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳，你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我没事，老毛病了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些武器——全新，十分精良，但看上面的灰尘......已经被封存了有些日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"制式上，不是军队配发的那些标准品，更像是为执行隐秘作战而特别定制的。而且，并非出自伦蒂尼姆的兵工厂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来那位名叫“铣痕”的女士，绝非只是什么我们没打过交道的帮派分子而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，她其实是某位大人物在伦蒂尼姆城里的眼线？那么，她愿意和我们交换武器，就意味着——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别总盼着自己能在大人物的游戏里捞到个什么好角色。她现在才找上我们，大概率是之前这些东西有别的用途，只是没来得及派上用场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也不排除“铣痕”女士捣毁了某个公爵藏在伦蒂尼姆的秘密军火库，“无私”地把这些东西分给了我们，谁知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过无论她究竟有什么目的，对我们都已经不重要了，只能走一步看一步而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从天空变成红色以后，我们已经做了几次侦察行动了，不知道为什么，现在的海布里区根本看不到什么萨卡兹大兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不意味着我们安全了，正相反，这说明萨卡兹判断管理城市已经没有意义了，什么流水线，武器车间......都已经对他们没用了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我昨天去玛格纳区看了一眼，那里现在变成了一座巨大的法阵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成百上千号人被困在那些诡异的巫术里，萨卡兹在用他们的生命力催动自己的那些祭坛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，要是战争再这么下去，很快就轮到我们了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来你打算怎么办？把我们偷偷造的那东西开出来，然后——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别犯蠢，别以为自己拿到了些还不错的装备就真成了什么超级特种兵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有了几把能用的武器，要是萨卡兹来清剿我们，这几把武器能让我们在转移的时候有点自保的本钱，但也仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“等待一个机会”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是机会什么时候才会来呢，凯瑟琳女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你们是？！我们的位置暴露了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我认识你们的那身衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位大费周章，在这个时候进入伦蒂尼姆，甚至还调查了我们几个一番......哼，不知道我们区区几个老工人，对你们有什么用呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“整合运动”的各位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第十三号通风管道在运转，五十四号运输索道也有磨痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建议你们之后再仔细排查一遍，我们能发现，萨卡兹也有可能发现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初次见面，我是整合运动的九。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你们这些危险分子钻入伦蒂尼姆的地下，只是为了当好心人，和我们说这些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是想知道，你们打算等到什么时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听队伍里以前在萨迪恩区工作过的兄弟们说，伦蒂尼姆的工人们总是骄傲于自己造出了这座伟大的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，无论是战前还是现在，这座城市属于过你们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳女士，你的身体状况——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说过你们的传言，你们是挺厉害。但别和我宣扬那套非感染者抢走了一切的理论，我不感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在如今的伦蒂尼姆，身上长了几片石头又怎样？我们要操心的事多得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，非感染者......在如今的伦蒂尼姆，讨论这些毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你们打算夺回自己的城市吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从所有漠视着这一切发生的人手中，从所有让事情发展至此的人手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......伦蒂尼姆现在是座飘满了源石粉尘的城市。会有许多人染病，会有许多人因此而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而凶手将得到清算，不管他们究竟是谁，不管他们的身上长没长石头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动不会只是在结局等待。不再会了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，还记得我吗，汤米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马约尔？！你不是因为得了病，所以被——哦，所以你在整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我又回来了。给，这是些抗感染的药，一天一片，没啥大用，你还是得祈祷你自己的运气够好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话......在你离开工厂的时候，你那种眼神......我还以为，你巴不得我们所有人都变成和你一样的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......在那时候，我说不定真是那么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"但害我丢了工作的不是你，也不是凯瑟琳，我知道你们帮我说了不少好话，但当时规矩就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员A","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"可未来......不一定了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"装备使用与维护，高浓度源石环境行动准则，战术协同，隐秘行动——在任何你们需要的地方，我们都可以出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们愿意的话，我们会帮助你们解放这里......从所有只是将这里发生的一切视作“代价”的上位者手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算没有你们的帮助，我们也一定会夺回城市，来自整合运动的“九”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合作愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遥远的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哀珐尼尔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"母亲......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的身影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您是来为我送行的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的孩子，你伤得很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我做了自己所能做的，可依然失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我并不会因此后悔我选择的道路，也不会怀疑我相信的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是......让您失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你战胜了无数强大的敌人，多少年来，女妖王庭不曾出现过如你这般强大、坚定的战士与王庭之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖王庭以你杰出的天赋与坚定的信念为荣，嗯，即使你不认同王庭传统，你也是我的骄傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就请您为我吹奏最后的挽歌吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"母亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我亲爱的孩子，别想偷懒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不到应该沉睡的时候，醒来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不是已经——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈玛莲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哀珐尼尔，该起床了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g16_scourgeswamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖风格的装置","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你终于醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"母亲......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你还认得出我的声音，这也让我不至于心寒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，不该对久别的母亲来一个热情的吻颊礼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并无此意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个奇特的装置......您难道，一直跟在我身边？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？不......怎么会呢。我亲爱的孩子已经长大了，作为母亲当然会放他去自由成长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是一段慈爱的咒言，装在了这个特别的装置上，这样就可以记录下你生活里重要的时刻，留作收藏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确没想到，除了你在战场上精彩的表现......还记录下了你换上这身衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该怎么说......虽然是特蕾西娅殿下定下的款式，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你喜欢就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起挑剔我的穿着，您对这个装置造型的设计......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道不觉得它非常可爱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖应当珍视言语的分量，而放弃与一个装置争论美与丑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱但严厉的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么能这么说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱但严厉的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是你的母亲，还有各位姐妹赋予了深沉爱意的装置！你怎能如此轻视我们的情谊，还有我们的审美！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"母亲......谢谢您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，你的同伴还在等着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈爱的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我永远为你感到骄傲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g1_originiumcanyon"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（震慑的咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面是断崖，已经没有路了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，碎片大厦的方向......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......来不及了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"提卡兹的最后一缕残留最终还是消散在了大地之上。\n但它得到了首肯，得到了答允，得到了回应。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i10"},{"type":"narration","text":"起初，并没有什么鲜明的感觉。\n只是，红色的天空中，阴云不再汇聚于碎片大厦的尖顶。不知不觉中，有另一样东西取代了它们的位置。\n枝蔓拥簇之下，鲜红的果实终于结出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这是个十足怪异的场景，但与其说让人心生恐惧，倒不如说是豁然开朗。似乎只是本该如此，本就如此。\n似乎“世界”本就以这样的模样运行，人们只是一不小心打开了钟表的后盖，发现了一直被忽视的发条和齿轮。\n源石是泰拉生态的一部分，大气中的源石带来天灾，人体中的源石引发疾病，就连昆虫都知道为自己构筑布满了源石的硬壳。\n源石与泰拉共生，这已经成了个公理，就如同平行线永不相交一样自然而然。\n可是，源石又从哪里来？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g1_originiumcanyon"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"“阿喃那”还是降临了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪师对“阿喃那”的控制超过预期，我们还是慢了一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"它还会成为萨卡兹的武器吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"诸王之息还能抵抗它吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......“阿喃那”能带来的不止是天灾，它的功能也远不止作为武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不仅是萨卡兹的原点......甚至可以说，是泰拉现在一切的原点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也许会成为我们迄今为止所面临的......不，整个泰拉迄今为止所面临的，最大的危机之一。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们还有机会阻止它吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"要先想办法离开这里！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“生命脊椎”，W小姐还在那里，我们可以借助那只巨兽的能力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等，我正在尝试联络W小姐——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，还是联络不到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂——终......于！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......兔子......你们在......哪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们就快......曼弗雷......正在......赫德雷已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说好的时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐！太好了，他们还在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是信号的干扰太强了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"W，想办法起飞！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......在哪？我怎么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"去找最大的动静，我们就在那里！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯中断了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您说的“动静”是......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这里到处都是源石。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"最能吸引W的是什么？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过于冒险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......值得一试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"narration","text":"十二小时之前\n行动开始后五十八小时"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，我们已经控制“生命脊椎”中枢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"检查骸骨，试图抵抗的佣兵全部杀死，通知娜汀，让她带领外围部队清剿剩下的佣兵，一个不留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"围绕骸骨严密部署防御工事，然后，在骸骨上安装足量的爆破装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，您是要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血漫到曼弗雷德脚下，他看了看躺在地上的人，眼神没有过多停留，转过身离开了舱室。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，我们在“生命脊椎”中俘虏的敌方雇佣兵，您看如何处置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是全部了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们发现，其中也有不少曾经为军事委员会效力的佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全部处死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德......将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......明椒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该在这里看到你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......之前在运输货物的时候，被这里的佣兵们抓住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要尽可能保护我的小队成员活下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能解释，在军事委员会进攻这具骸骨时，你没有响应我们的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......你还潜藏在这里，是打算做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我只是......有点害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，你的上一份任务结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在新的任务是，处死这些背叛了军事委员会的佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......他们都已经被俘虏了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为战士，他们背叛了组织；作为佣兵，他们单方面撕毁了合约。无论从哪方面讲，他们都需要付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，他们已经没有能力反抗了，也不会对您造成威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的杀戮，还有意义吗？您不是自己也说过，想让更多的萨卡兹能从这片战场上回到家吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，我已经给了你选择的机会，还有足够的耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是今天第一个令我失望的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工程术师已经排查过一遍，“生命脊椎”基本框架完好，雇佣兵并没有直接改造骸骨的手段，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军战士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在骸骨上安装炸药的时候，发现了不少并非由我们安装的炸弹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炸弹？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王庭军斥候","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"将军，我们联系不到娜汀旗尉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷那个古董脑袋有时候还是管点用的，曼弗雷德，你果然会带着小队来突袭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，这好像是我们第一次正式见面吧，自我介绍一下，我是巴别塔的成员，也是来收走你的烂命的人，你可以叫我W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷小队的佣兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还敢回来送死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你就没有想过，你们突袭骸骨这么顺利，那雇佣兵都去了哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看现在是谁落入了谁的包围？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就凭这些散兵游勇，也想对抗军事委员会的战士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很骄傲嘛，你最好祈祷你的骨头会和嘴一样硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为在你的军队打进来之前，我会先炸掉你的脑袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"曼弗雷德想要挥刀向前，脚下的影子缠住了他的四肢，他不及挣脱，散布周围的炸弹连续炸开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，你最好瞄准点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别抱怨了！我说过，我很擅长把控爆炸范围！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想毁了骸骨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，心疼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不会像赫德雷那么婆婆妈妈，有必要的话，我一点也不介意让这个骨头架子给你陪葬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猜猜看，失去了这个大宝贝和死了最喜欢的养子，哪件事会让特雷西斯更难过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你休想！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看上去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"浑身染血的刺客拦住了强敌的剑，她的袖刃没有丝毫动摇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要杀我？你准备的决心还不够。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶，把这个金毛脑袋摘下来给我，我就考虑接下来一年的任务都听你指挥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i37"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶，我不止一次问过你。你如今相信的究竟是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信，我们之间的分歧会在此时此地结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这一次，我不会再认错人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"narration","text":"行动开始后七十小时"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......哈......真是一点都不让人消停。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“吊塔”！你的人呢？！叫你守在脊椎顶上，怎么还一直放空降兵下来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差点忘了，“吊塔”死了有一会了。都怪曼弗雷德，连我的脑子都快打麻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还在外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们走的时候得带上一大堆尸体了，可喜可贺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W！我没看错吧，这里的神经束是不是在发光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士他们，成功了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的通讯声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的通讯声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想办法——飞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的通讯声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——找最大的动静——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他们的通讯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊内丝，帮我看看，赫德雷还有气吗？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（微弱的呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好......血基本止住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就别磨蹭了！快喊他起来，让他的巨兽朋友醒来干活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说不可能的事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，赫德雷还得再躺会儿，它可躺得够久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老骨头！醒醒！这个风格的闹铃你喜欢吗——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W你个疯子！赫德雷还受着重伤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在一声声爆炸声中，浑浊的声音在厅堂里响起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑浊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑浊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是你们几个。通晓历史的萨卡兹，是谁把你揍成了这副样子？你们的大冒险失败了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少废话！如果不想你剩下的最后一点碎骨头都被炸得干干净净的话，就送我们离开这里！最好把你身上那些王庭军跳蚤也甩下去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑浊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我都忘了。我的身体还在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑浊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是别强巨兽所难，在我身上你们都是差不多大的跳蚤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑浊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，总之先走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着一声浑浊的叹息，时空的乱流一瞬间涌起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次......是我赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是什么胜利。我花的时间太多，而且......你从来没有这么软弱过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前的战斗消耗了你太多力气，这样的作战也不是你擅长的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前也并未认真对我出剑，我们都曾错失良机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶，你很清楚，新的卡兹戴尔已经铸成，而你在对抗的，是在这未来之中的我们自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“未来”，呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说过，我从来没有看清过殿下所想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我现在已经明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下没有完成的事业，会有人替她完成。阿米娅，凯尔希......我会铲除阻拦她们的障碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是在执迷不悟，到底要怎么样你才会明白，这也是特蕾西娅殿下的愿望！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我和你只是敌人......而且我们早就不能回头了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“生命脊椎”正在启动？怎么可能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的计划失败了，你已经阻止不了我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这具骸骨会被毁灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不允许有人......威胁到将军为卡兹戴尔带来的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算我们都不是可以看到未来的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"曼弗雷德扔下了剑，从怀中取出了引爆器。他的手指就扣在开关上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"迟疑。\n为什么？\n久经沙场，自己一人的生死早就可以弃之不顾。他本不该犹豫。\n可是“生命脊椎”......\n会是多少人回家的路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1344_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在曼弗雷德犹豫的一刹那，阿斯卡纶用尽最后一丝力气扑向了他。\n两具伤痕累累的身躯撞在一起，一同掉入时空乱流中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g1_originiumcanyon"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就是这里。整个结晶山峰能量最密集的地方。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样引发的源石反应会极端剧烈且不可控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，做好准备。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"只能赌一把了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的法术没入山峦一般巨大的源石之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"崩塌开始了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你习以为常地抱住Mon3tr的爪子，Mon3tr欢快地嘶鸣着，飞速奔驰起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"毁灭的能量在你们的身后肆意释放着，恐怖的轰鸣一刻都未曾停歇。\n这场反应如此之剧烈，以至于你身边的一切都在为之战栗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灵幛” (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1331_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但食腐者的军团会追随战栗而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灵幛”正在追击我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要战斗，不要被他们挡住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"由破损军旗缠裹身躯的战士汇聚着，飘荡着，他们被源石反应吞没，但更多的他们再次填补追猎的队伍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不满的鸣叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“灵幛”缠绕上了Mon3tr的身躯，他们空洞的呼吸声回荡在你的耳畔。\n食腐者的战士想把你们都拖进死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“争斗之影，为争斗所斥退。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Logos！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请相信你的精英干员们，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们总会在你最需要的时刻出现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我永远都相信你。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你值得信赖。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不要松懈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到了时空的潮涌，巨兽就要来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会尝试用咒术在此地建立道标，帮助我们准确登上骸骨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我该怎么做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从这个悬崖上跳下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......好的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我有点想收回刚说的话。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间紧迫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，阿米娅，凯尔希医生，就是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W！继续驾驶巨兽，剩下的王庭军我在处理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我在驾驶吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骨头架子，去，呃，战场上动静最大的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有回应，浑浊的声音并未响起，也许只是它懒得言语。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它会不会把我们送进什么超级大炮的炮管里面？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虚幻的潮水退去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它确实把我们送进了一场爆炸的正中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是不错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"银白咒言组成的纤绳扯住了漂行的巨兽，几个身影坠入船舱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子？女妖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还真把你们接上了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们成功会合了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"还是得用爆炸吸引爆炸狂。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干得不错啊，你们还真的从赦罪师的邪恶仪式现场活着跑出来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你们这边怎么样？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了，骨头架子没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷挨了曼弗雷德一剑，但是还能喘气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于其他的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"怎么没有见到阿斯卡纶？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骸骨上没有发现阿斯卡纶和曼弗雷德的踪迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她应该被曼弗雷德拖住了，骸骨起飞的时候，她没来得及跟上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，阿斯卡纶的实力毋庸置疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请像信任我一样信任她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，在这里掉眼泪也改变不了情况。眼下要做的事情还有的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们下一步计划是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经吸引了太多注意，我们需要马上进行下一轮漂流。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员A"]}]}
